commit f5c1241d79fff88e48b0d0a6dbde3b36f026e6ed

C03: a search that found nothing useful is a failure statement in the shell (WEB1271 repair)

WEB1269: the mind published «The web search results were irrelevant to the
weather in Santiago.» but UserMessagePolicy.LooksLikeFailure did not
recognise it and the reply was rejected as reversed_result until the
retries ran out.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


